@title Part tools centre: catalog, assign, describe and clean up as tiles
@area Layout
# Lane V4i (docs/design/visual-redesign.md section 6). Edit > Part tools... opens one window
# with what File > Library and Edit > Parts held; neither submenu is in the menus any more.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text Edit #1
wait 6
shot edit-menu-one-parts-row
expect "Part tools..."
click_text "Part tools..."
wait 10
shot centre-open
expect "Catalog"
expect "Parts on the devices"
expect "Choose a tool"
check_layout
click_text "Remove unused parts"
wait 6
shot centre-picked-unused
expect "Removes the parts no device uses any more."
check_layout
text catalog
wait 8
shot centre-search-catalog
expect "Import 3D model (STEP)"
expect_not "Remove unused parts"
check_layout
key Escape
wait 6
expect_not "Choose a tool"
